{
  "title": "Quick Springy Malaysian Millet Pilaf",
  "description": "A quick and flavorful Malaysian dish featuring millet, with a mustardy and springy texture, made with a mantecare emulsification method and dash-friendly ingredients.",
  "cuisine": "Malaysian",
